The '''Lizardman Canyon''' is a valley in the west portion of [[Great Kourend]], between [[Lovakengj]] and [[Shayzien]]. The valley is where [[lizardmen]] and [[lizardman brute]]s reside, and is the responsibility of the Shayzien soldiers to keep them contained.

A wounded soldier overlooking both canyons can inform players of how many people are inside either canyon.

The easiest way to get there is by using the [[fairy ring]] with the code {{fairycode|DJR}}.

==Features==
The Lizardman canyon contains two valleys; the east and west.

The eastern canyon contains only lizardmen and lizardmen brutes. In the middle of this canyon there is a single-combat zone, while the rest is multi-combat. Soldiers are always engaging the lizardmen in battle, and it is a popular choice with slayers seeking to complete their task but not tackle the more dangerous [[lizardman shaman]]s.

The western canyon is accessible via the [[Handholds (Lizardman Canyon)|handholds]] and contains all three lizardmen types including the dangerous shamans. Three shamans can be found in the western canyon, one spawn in the north-west, east and south-west quadrants. The south-eastern quadrant of this canyon contains both lizardmen and lizardmen brutes fighting a small group of soldiers.

